<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Clifford plans A$12 mln pref issue.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Clifford plans A$12 mln pref issue.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investment group Clifford Corp Ltd said on Thursday it plans to raise A$12 million through a converting preference share issue.</p>
<p>Clifford said the issue would be fully underwritten and would be made to institutions and existing shareholders.</p>
</text>
